Hi,

Mike Gorchak informed me that the QNX driver for SiS 7019 is available
with the full source code.  It's based on ALSA 0.5, hence very likely
possible to port to the latest ALSA version.
Currently, it's under BSD license, but Mike will change it to GPL/BSD
dual license soon.

The URL is:
	http://mike.qnx.org.ru/sis/index_e.htm

I have little time for porting this right now (and have no test
hardware), so if anyone is interested in it, just go ahead, take it 
and port it.  Don't hesitate to ask here questions about the porting.


Takashi


